<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Apr oil product stocks up 22.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Apr oil product stocks up 22.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Monday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-April:</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	2,425	 15,253     +2.5    +10.2</p>
<p> Naphtha	 1,898	 11,938    +13.7    +20.4</p>
<p> Jet Fuel	  773	  4,862    +13.7    +41.1</p>
<p> Kerosene	2,742	 17,247    +13.2    +50.5</p>
<p> Gas Oil	 2,453	 15,429    +12.7    +24.4</p>
<p> Fuel Oil A    1,912	 12,027     +8.4    +23.4</p>
<p> Fuel Oil B	  4	     25     +0.0     +0.0</p>
<p> Fuel Oil C    2,316	 14,568     +2.1     +7.1</p>
<p> Total	  14,524	 91,356     +8.8    +22.8</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off.)</p>
</text>
